Xuantie GNU Toolchain licensing note
====================================

Upstream: https://github.com/XUANTIE-RV/xuantie-gnu-toolchain
Pinned ref used by .github/workflows/build.yml: V3.0.1
  (commit c66309b74edd581125a8165f07296c85d3fa71c9, branch xuantie-gnu-toolchain)

The Xuantie GNU Toolchain (GCC, Binutils, newlib/glibc, GDB) is
GPL-licensed (see upstream LICENSE / COPYING files).

When you distribute binaries built by the workflow in this repo
(e.g. via GitHub Releases as xuantie-gnu-toolchain-macos-arm64.tar.gz),
you must comply with the GPL: provide or offer the corresponding
source, e.g. by linking the release notes / README to the exact
upstream commit above plus any patches applied in build.yml.

This file is not legal advice. Check upstream LICENSE before
redistributing.
